# Upload the built bundle and the Dockerfile, nothing else. The image carries the
# artifact, never the toolchain that made it, so source and node_modules would only
# make the build slower and the layer bigger.
#
# NOTE this file is why the build context is `apps/jobs`: the REPO ROOT
# .gcloudignore excludes dist/, which would drop the bundle itself.
*
!Dockerfile
!dist/
!dist/index.mjs
